!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: OCI-AML1
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = guide rna: sgAAVS1 tagged with tRFP647
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = knockdown: shLuciferase tagged with GFP
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: DMSO
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = UM171 and UM134  were used at 500nM, TCP1 was used at 10uM
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = AML1 cell lines with sgRNA or shRNA of interest were cultured in DMEM/10% FBS and exposed to UM171, UM134, TCP1 (LSD1 inhibitor) or DMSO for 0, 24, 48 or 72h as indicated.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Trizol extraction + QIAGEN RNAeasy Clean-up
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = NEB mRNA stranded library preparation
!Sample_data_processing = Basecalls performed using Illumina RTA.
!Sample_data_processing = Samples demultiplexed using bcl2fastq 2.20.
!Sample_data_processing = Sequenced reads were trimmed for sequencing adapters and low quality extrimities and mapped to the reference genome using STAR version 2.7.1a
!Sample_data_processing = Readcounts were computed by STAR during sequence alignment based on annotations from Gencode version 32, based on Ensembl version 92.
!Sample_data_processing = Expression values were also computed using RSEM version 1.2.28 based on Gencode version 32 transcript annotations
!Sample_data_processing = Reported expression values take into account a reverse strand orientation.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Readcounts: Tab-delimited file where columns are Ensembl gene identifier, counts for unstranded RNA, counts for 1st strand aligned, counts for 2nd strand aligned
