!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: OCI-AML1
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = guide rna: sgKBTBD4 tagged with tRFP647
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = knockdown: shRCOR1 tagged with GFP
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: DMSO
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = UM171 and UM134  were used at 500nM, TCP1 was used at 10uM
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = AML1 cell lines with sgRNA or shRNA of interest were cultured in DMEM/10% FBS and exposed to UM171, UM134, TCP1 (LSD1 inhibitor) or DMSO for 0, 24, 48 or 72h as indicated.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Trizol extraction + QIAGEN RNAeasy Clean-up
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = NEB mRNA stranded library preparation
