!Sample_data_processing = Samples demultiplexed using bcl2fastq 2.20.
!Sample_data_processing = Sequenced reads were trimmed for sequencing adapters and low quality extrimities and mapped to the reference genome using STAR version 2.7.1a
!Sample_data_processing = Readcounts were computed by STAR during sequence alignment based on annotations from Gencode version 32, based on Ensembl version 92.
!Sample_data_processing = Expression values were also computed using RSEM version 1.2.28 based on Gencode version 32 transcript annotations
!Sample_data_processing = Reported expression values take into account a reverse strand orientation.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38
